{"schemaVersion":1,"sourceRecord":{"schemaVersion":1,"recordId":"wikibooks-21170-r4496872","sourceId":"wikibooks-cookbook-cc-by-sa","sourceTitle":"Cookbook:Smore (Eurasian Beef Stew)","sourcePageId":21170,"sourceRevision":"4496872","sourceRevisionTimestamp":"2025-05-29T23:57:29Z","sourceRevisionUser":"Kittycataclysm","sourceUrl":"https://en.wikibooks.org/w/index.php?title=Cookbook:Smore%20(Eurasian%20Beef%20Stew)&oldid=4496872","retrievedAt":"2026-10-13T16:17:33.011Z","sourceCategories":["Category:Easy recipes","Category:Malaysian recipes","Category:Recipes","Category:Recipes using baking soda","Category:Recipes using beef shank","Category:Recipes using carrot","Category:Recipes using cilantro","Category:Recipes using cinnamon stick","Category:Recipes using fresh ginger","Category:Recipes using garlic","Category:Recipes using hot dog","Category:Recipes using sugar","Category:Recipes with metric units","Category:Recipes without cooking time","Category:Recipes without servings"],"license":{"id":"wikibooks-cookbook-cc-by-sa-4.0","name":"Creative Commons Attribution-ShareAlike 4.0 International (CC BY-SA 4.0); Wikibooks text is generally dual-licensed with GFDL unless otherwise noted","evidenceUrl":"https://en.wikibooks.org/wiki/Wikibooks:Copyrights","policyStatus":"verified-license","pageExceptionStatus":"not-reviewed-per-page","attribution":"Attribute Wikibooks contributors by linking each version-specific source page. Indicate that structured fields are extracted and any translated or edited text is modified. Include CC BY-SA 4.0 notice/link and share adaptations under CC BY-SA 4.0 or later.","changeNoticeRequired":true,"shareAlikeRequired":true},"sourceSha256":"073156371136aacf3ceb8330f66c1b24cd9cd9eecaf054283d62c708b0bfc7aa","sourceWikitext":"__NOTOC__{{Recipe summary\n| Category = Stew recipes\n| Difficulty = 2\n}}\n\n{{recipe}}\n\nThis is an Eurasian dish, not to be confused with the American dessert made with toasted marshmallows (s'mores).\n\n==Ingredients==\n=== Marinating ===\n* 300 [[Cookbook:Gram|g]] [[Cookbook:beef|beef]] shank \n* ¼ [[Cookbook:Teaspoon|teaspoon]] [[Cookbook:Baking Soda|bicarbonate of soda]]\n* 2 [[Cookbook:Tablespoon|tablespoons]] ground [[Cookbook:pepper|pepper]] \n* 1 teaspoon [[Cookbook:salt|salt]] \n* 1 teaspoon [[Cookbook:sugar|sugar]] \n* 2 tablespoons [[Cookbook:vinegar|vinegar]] \n* 4 tablespoons dark [[Cookbook:Soy Sauce|soya sauce]] \n* 2 tablespoons [[Cookbook:oil|oil]]\n* 420 [[Cookbook:Milliliter|ml]] water\n\n=== Cooking ===\n* 3 [[Cookbook:onion|onion]]s \n* 5 cloves [[Cookbook:garlic|garlic]] \n* 1 thumb-sized piece [[Cookbook:ginger|ginger]], julienned\n* 10 cm piece [[Cookbook:cinnamon|cinnamon]], rinsed\n* 100 g small [[Cookbook:carrot|carrot]]s, peeled and [[Cookbook:Slicing|sliced]] diagonally \n* 3 [[Cookbook:potato|potato]]es, peeled and quartered\n* 1 [[Cookbook:tomato|tomato]], quartered\n* [[Cookbook:Spam|Spam]] (optional) \n* Chicken hot dogs (optional)\n* 1 sprig [[Cookbook:Cilantro|coriander leaves]], leaves plucked\n\n== Procedure == \n=== Marinating ===\n# Wash and cut beef into 2.5 cm chunks. \n# Drain in [[Cookbook:Colander|colander]]. \n# Combine beef with bicarbonate of soda, pepper, salt, sugar, vinegar and dark soya sauce.\n# Leave for 30 minutes to [[Cookbook:Marinating|marinate]].\n\n=== Cooking ===\n# Grind onions and garlic together.\n# Soak carrots and potatoes in water.\n# Heat oil in a pot. When hot, [[Cookbook:Frying|fry]] ground onion and garlic, shredded ginger, and cinnamon until the onions are brown and fragrant.\n# Add marinated beef. Fry until meat changes color.\n# Add water and [[Cookbook:Simmering|simmer]] until meat is tender. Stir occasionally to prevent meat from sticking to pot. Add more water if gravy is too thick, and season accordingly. \n# Add carrots and cook for 5 minutes.\n# Add potatoes and cook until soft.\n# Add tomato. If you like, you may add a tin of Spam luncheon meat, cut into thick slices or chicken franks at this step.\n# Garnish with coriander leaves and serve. \n\n[[Category:Malaysian recipes|{{PAGENAME}}]]\n[[Category:Recipes using beef shank]]\n[[Category:Recipes_with_metric_units|{{PAGENAME}}]]\n[[Category:Recipes using baking soda]]\n[[Category:Recipes using sugar]]\n[[Category:Recipes using carrot]]\n[[Category:Recipes using cilantro]]\n[[Category:Recipes using cinnamon stick]]\n[[Category:Recipes using garlic]]\n[[Category:Recipes using fresh ginger]]\n[[Category:Recipes using hot dog]]","isRecipe":true,"recipe":{"name":"Smore (Eurasian Beef Stew)","nameAr":null,"servings":null,"servingsSourceText":null,"ingredients":[{"id":"source-line-1","name":"300 g beef shank","sourceText":"300 g beef shank","amountText":"300 g beef shank","amount":null,"unit":null,"foodBinding":null},{"id":"source-line-2","name":"¼ teaspoon bicarbonate of soda","sourceText":"¼ teaspoon bicarbonate of soda","amountText":"¼ teaspoon bicarbonate of soda","amount":null,"unit":null,"foodBinding":null},{"id":"source-line-3","name":"2 tablespoons ground pepper","sourceText":"2 tablespoons ground pepper","amountText":"2 tablespoons ground pepper","amount":null,"unit":null,"foodBinding":null},{"id":"source-line-4","name":"1 teaspoon salt","sourceText":"1 teaspoon salt","amountText":"1 teaspoon salt","amount":null,"unit":null,"foodBinding":null},{"id":"source-line-5","name":"1 teaspoon sugar","sourceText":"1 teaspoon sugar","amountText":"1 teaspoon sugar","amount":null,"unit":null,"foodBinding":null},{"id":"source-line-6","name":"2 tablespoons vinegar","sourceText":"2 tablespoons vinegar","amountText":"2 tablespoons vinegar","amount":null,"unit":null,"foodBinding":null},{"id":"source-line-7","name":"4 tablespoons dark soya sauce","sourceText":"4 tablespoons dark soya sauce","amountText":"4 tablespoons dark soya sauce","amount":null,"unit":null,"foodBinding":null},{"id":"source-line-8","name":"2 tablespoons oil","sourceText":"2 tablespoons oil","amountText":"2 tablespoons oil","amount":null,"unit":null,"foodBinding":